AIO Life Query runtime images

Hasura engine: https://github.com/hasura/graphql-engine
Official image release: ghcr.io/hasura/v3-engine:v2026.10.05
Upstream source license: Apache-2.0; see hasura-engine.LICENSE.
The engine executable and entrypoint are unchanged from the official image.

PostgreSQL connector: https://github.com/hasura/ndc-postgres
Official release: v3.1.0
License: Apache-2.0; see ndc-postgres.LICENSE.
The connector binary is unchanged; the image adds an AIO Life startup guard.

Exact multi-platform image digests are recorded in deploy/upstreams.lock.json.
